# Version

## Current Version

`0.7.6`

## Version Type

Minor planner-feature release over `0.7.5`.

This version implements deterministic Phase 4 planner support for Human1/Human2 conversation history in `@office-dsl/llm-planner`. `mockPlanConversationHistory` converts `intent-contract.conversation.v1` fixtures into valid partial `intent-contract.dsl.v1` snapshots, preserves every message as a source reference, extracts simple payment and deadline hints, and keeps unresolved legal or approval details as blocking questions instead of guessing values.

The Phase 3 diagnosis, Phase 4 question routing, conversation input format, and mock conversation-history planner are model/planner layers only. Live OpenRouter conversation planning, CLI, backend, and UI integration of full conversation history, diagnosis, routing, and finalization gates remains open (Phases 5, 11, and 12). No OCR or document-ingestion behavior is implemented in this version; Phase 4B is roadmap documentation only.

